  "description": "Analyzes the significance of interaction frequency for fan classification",
  "definition": "'Daily' users log into the platform at least once per day on average; 'Weekly' users log in 3-5 times per week; 'Monthly' users log in 1-2 times per month; 'Occasional' users have login intervals exceeding one month. Interaction frequency affects platform push priority, content recommendations, and event invitations, with Daily users considered the platform's core active group."
